      'Turn-flow example: Standard trick-taking. You must follow suit if possible, but you can ALWAYS play a trump even if you have the suit led.',
      "Scoring example: Each team keeps a cumulative score. Points are won by capturing scoring trumps in tricks (ace 1, king 25, jack 1, ten 1, nine 9, right pedro 5, left pedro 5, three 15, two 1). The two (low) is scored by the team that was dealt it. First team to 152 wins. First team to reach 152 or more points wins. If bidder's team makes their bid they add points taken; if not they subtract the bid. Opponents always add points they take..",
